name: Spare Trousers — two-pair scaling
author: corpus
description: >-
  Spare Trousers gains +2 Mult if the played hand contains a Two Pair. First-shop
  scaling: pair with Clever Joker, Dusk for retrigger, and Oops All 6s? No, it's not a
  probability. Just commit to Two Pair.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - joker: SpareTrousers
    antes: [1]
    sources:
      shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
      boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: CleverJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Dusk
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 25
  - joker: TheDuo
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
